From d30f90b69566b4d9055e597bd824932e25e4daf6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] harden outbound jobs and correlate worker logs

Cross-repository lessons:
- Scrapling: downstream Retry-After may lengthen, never shorten, local backoff.
- Paperless-ngx: validate DNS at connect time and pin the actual socket destination.
- Paperless-ngx: propagate background task identity through logging context.

No database schema or queue replacement.

